design_notes = "Stasis Bubble introduces a canonical Time-native stasis state through the shared status policy. Status-aware actors stop movement and actions while stasis is sustained. Rigid bodies are frozen with linear and angular velocity snapshots, then restored on release. Bosses are immune by default unless explicitly marked stasis_vulnerable."
